    <statement><p>Find parametric equations for the sphere centered at the
origin and with radius 7.  Use the parameters <m>s</m> and <m>t</m>
in your answer.</p>
<p><m>x(s,t) =</m> <fillin characters="45" name="AnSwEr0001"/>,</p>
<p><m>y(s,t) =</m> <fillin characters="45" name="AnSwEr0002"/>, and</p>
<p><m>z(s,t) =</m> <fillin characters="45" name="AnSwEr0003"/>, where</p>
<p><fillin characters="10" name="AnSwEr0004"/> <m>\le s\le</m> <fillin characters="10" name="AnSwEr0005"/> and</p>
<p><fillin characters="10" name="AnSwEr0006"/> <m>\le t\le</m> <fillin characters="10" name="AnSwEr0007"/>.</p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>7\cos\mathopen{}\left(t\right)\sin\mathopen{}\left(s\right)</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>7\sin\mathopen{}\left(t\right)\sin\mathopen{}\left(s\right)</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>7\cos\mathopen{}\left(s\right)</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>0</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>2\pi </m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>0</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\pi </m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <solution><m>\phi = s</m> and <m>\theta = t</m> as the two
parameters.  Since the radius is 7,  we can take
<me>x = 7\cos\mathopen{}\left(t\right)\sin\mathopen{}\left(s\right), \quad
y = 7\sin\mathopen{}\left(t\right)\sin\mathopen{}\left(s\right), \quad \mbox{and}\quad
z = 7\cos\mathopen{}\left(s\right),</me>
with
<me>0\le s\le\pi\quad\mbox{and}\quad 0\le t\le 2\pi.</me>



</solution>
